# Filtration Formalism

This file formalizes the σ-algebras generated by cylinder sets at each depth,
forming a filtration.

## References

- fdrs.md, Phase 1 Fragment 3
- σ-algebras ℱ_L generated by length-L cylinders
- Monotone nesting: ℱ_1 ⊆ ℱ_2 ⊆ ℱ_3 ⊆ ...
- Connection to Borel σ-algebra

## Status

SCAFFOLDING ONLY - proofs not yet attempted
-/

